---
layout: layout
title: "{dev.talk} - Available Speaker Slots"
description: "Dates and session slots still open for accepted {dev.talk} speakers."
permalink: speaker-slots.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
includeBlueskyPosts: false
includeSpeakerSlotsStyles: true
---

<section class="speaker-slots">
  <h1 data-speaker-greeting>Thanks for volunteering to speak at {dev.talk}!</h1>
  <p>We're really glad to have you. Have a look at the dates below, pick the one that suits you and press "I want this date". It should open an email in your email client with your details already filled in, so just review it and hit send.</p>
<p>{dev.talk} events are held in the evening between 7pm-9pm at <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/T7gidKeBQcE1Cuvk7">Bournemouth University, Talbot Campus</a>.</p>
<p>As we are a community group, we are unable to offer expenses to our speakers.</p>
  <h2>Before you choose</h2>
  <ul class="speaker-slots-help">
    <li>We have a <a href="https://devdottalk.uk/discord">Discord server</a> if you want to join in</li>
    <li><a href="/attending.html">What to expect</a> when you come along</li>
    <li><a href="/code-of-conduct.html">Code of conduct</a></li>
    <li><a href="/previous-events.html">Previous events</a> to get a feel for the evening</li>
    <li><a href="/speakers.html">Meet some of our past speakers</a></li>
    <li><a href="/faqs.html">FAQs</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Available dates</h2>
  <dl class="speaker-slots-who" data-speaker-summary hidden>
    <dt>Speaker</dt>
    <dd data-speaker-name></dd>
    <dt>Session</dt>
    <dd data-speaker-session></dd>
  </dl>

  <ul class="speaker-slots-list">
    {% for ev in events.upcoming | openSpeakerSlots(sessions.allEvents) %}
      <li class="speaker-slots-item">
        <h2>{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}</h2>
        <p>{{ ev.openSlots }} of 2 session slots available</p>
        <a class="speaker-slots-button" href="mailto:speaker@devdottalk.uk" data-slot-date="{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}">{{ ev.shortDate }} - I want this date</a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<script src="/speaker-slots.js"></script>
